                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "This new legislation is focused on the <w>individual</w> rather than the masses."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "In onze moderne samenleving staat de vrijheid van het <w>individu</w> vaak centraal in politieke discussies.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "In our modern society, the freedom of the <w>individual</w> is often central to political discussions."
